        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Arrow of Despair"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, enchantment, fear, incapacitation, mental, occult)\n\nA baykok creates an invisible arrow of bone as it draws its bow. A frightened creature hit by the arrow is stricken with loneliness and despair and must attempt a 26 Will save; if the Strike was a critical hit, the target uses the outcome one degree of success worse than the result of its save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is slowed 1 for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature's frightened value increases by 1 (to a maximum of 4), and it is slowed 1 until its frightened condition ends.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but the creature is paralyzed until its frightened condition ends. At the start of each of its turns, it can end the paralyzed condition early with a successful 26 Will save."
            },
            "id": "1c6c00f0-ee92-4f8e-94d1-0264c1c829e9",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:09.132201"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Wasting Curse"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(curse, necromancy, occult)\n\nThe baykok steals life from its victim and leaves listless dread in its place. If a target fails its save against Devour Life, it becomes drained 1. Each time the target gets a full night's rest, it must succeed at a 26 Fortitude save or its drained value increases rather than decreasing. The curse ends if the creature recovers from the drained condition, but if the creature would reach drained 5 from this effect, it dies."
            },
            "id": "fa553685-d3a8-4f55-9a1e-c4aabc2721ce",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:09.132201"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
