          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Devour Life"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(curse, necromancy, occult)\n\nRequirements: The baykok is adjacent to a paralyzed, restrained, or unconscious living humanoid\n\nThe baykok touches the target and devours part of its life force. The target must succeed at a 26 Fortitude save or be afflicted with the baykok's wasting curse. If the target fails and wasn't already affected by the wasting curse, the baykok gains 20 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour."
            },
